1
00:00:00,802 --> 00:00:03,682
(Wil:)It's my last one.
I want you to have it.

2
00:00:06,057 --> 00:00:08,937
(Sheldon:)Look, everyone.
Wil Wheaton is my friend!

3
00:00:12,856 --> 00:00:16,856
(Brent Spiner:)Oh, wow. I haven't seen
one of these in years.

4
00:00:18,236 --> 00:00:22,286
(Brent Spiner:)Remember how we used to make these
things look like they were masturbating?

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,830
(Sheldon:)Brent Spiner, what have you done?

6
00:00:24,993 --> 00:00:27,783
That was a mint-in-package
Wesley Crusher action figure.

7
00:00:27,954 --> 00:00:30,414
(Sheldon:)Signed by my close personal friend,
Wil Wheaton.

8
00:00:30,582 --> 00:00:34,002
(Brent:)Sorry, Slim. I've got some Mr. Data dolls
in the trunk of my car.

9
00:00:34,169 --> 00:00:35,709
(Brent:)You want me to sign one for you?

10
00:00:35,879 --> 00:00:38,089
(Sheldon:)You've already signed something,
Brent Spiner.

11
00:00:38,256 --> 00:00:40,676
(Sheldon:)Your name on my list.

12
00:00:43,178 --> 00:00:45,928
(Sheldon:)From this moment on,
you are my mortal enemy.

13
00:00:46,097 --> 00:00:48,807
(Wil:)Don't worry. It doesn't take up
a whole lot of your time.

14
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:53,100
(Sheldon:)Come on, buddy. Let's not waste
another second on this loser.

15
00:00:53,813 --> 00:00:55,903
(Sheldon:)Love your house.

16
00:00:57,108 --> 00:00:59,898
- Can we get autographed dolls?
- Sure.

17
00:01:01,029 --> 00:01:02,739
(Brent:)Twenty bucks.

18
00:01:05,575 --> 00:01:07,035
(Stuart:)Ten.

19
00:01:09,913 --> 00:01:11,493
- Eighteen.
- Twelve.

20
00:01:11,665 --> 00:01:13,745
- Sixteen.
- Two for 30.

21
00:01:13,917 --> 00:01:16,377
(Leonard:)And you come to my birthday party.

22
00:01:19,631 --> 00:01:21,171
(Howard:)Done.

